  "title": "Initialise acl_data to avoid wild pointer dereference",
  "description": "fix oss-fuzz issue 25007\n```\n==8==ERROR: AddressSanitizer: SEGV on unknown address 0x000000000000 (pc 0x000000bd22dd bp 0x7ffd24f6fa10 sp 0x7ffd24f6f780 T0)\n==8==The signal is caused by a READ memory access.\n==8==Hint: address points to the zero page.\nSCARINESS: 10 (null-deref)\n    #0 0xbd22dc in dissect_btavdtp /src/wireshark/epan/dissectors/packet-btavdtp.c:1543:17\n    #1 0x6d77a2 in call_dissector_through_handle /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:720:9\n    #2 0x6d77a2 in call_dissector_work /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:813:9\n    #3 0x6d7239 in dissector_try_uint_new /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:1413:8\n    #4 0xc4b167 in dissect_btl2cap /src/wireshark/epan/dissectors/packet-btl2cap.c:2654:14\n    #5 0x6d77a2 in call_dissector_through_handle /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:720:9\n    #6 0x6d77a2 in call_dissector_work /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:813:9\n    #7 0x6d410b in call_dissector_only /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:3233:8\n    #8 0x6d410b in call_dissector_with_data /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:3246:8\n    #9 0xc5bae8 in dissect_btle /src/wireshark/epan/dissectors/packet-btle.c:1720:21\n    #10 0x6d77a2 in call_dissector_through_handle /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:720:9\n    #11 0x6d77a2 in call_dissector_work /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:813:9\n    #12 0x6d410b in call_dissector_only /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:3233:8\n    #13 0x6d410b in call_dissector_with_data /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:3246:8\n    #14 0xc60837 in dissect_btle_rf /src/wireshark/epan/dissectors/packet-btle_rf.c:284:27\n    #15 0x6d77a2 in call_dissector_through_handle /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:720:9\n    #16 0x6d77a2 in call_dissector_work /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:813:9\n    #17 0x6d7239 in dissector_try_uint_new /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:1413:8\n    #18 0xb63791 in dissect_bluetooth /src/wireshark/epan/dissectors/packet-bluetooth.c:3776:10\n    #19 0x6d77a2 in call_dissector_through_handle /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:720:9\n    #20 0x6d77a2 in call_dissector_work /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:813:9\n    #21 0x6d7239 in dissector_try_uint_new /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:1413:8\n    #22 0x17d7af8 in dissect_pcap_pktdata /src/wireshark/epan/dissectors/packet-pcap_pktdata.c:378:14\n    #23 0x6d77a2 in call_dissector_through_handle /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:720:9\n    #24 0x6d77a2 in call_dissector_work /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:813:9\n    #25 0x6d410b in call_dissector_only /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:3233:8\n    #26 0x6d410b in call_dissector_with_data /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:3246:8\n    #27 0x18f13c9 in dissect_rftap /src/wireshark/epan/dissectors/packet-rftap.c:321:9\n    #28 0x18f15a2 in dissect_rftap_heur /src/wireshark/epan/dissectors/packet-rftap.c:342:12\n    #29 0x6dd7ca in dissector_try_heuristic /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:2827:9\n    #30 0x1d0364e in decode_udp_ports /src/wireshark/epan/dissectors/packet-udp.c:709:9\n    #31 0x1d08885 in dissect /src/wireshark/epan/dissectors/packet-udp.c:1261:5\n    #32 0x1d0565d in dissect_udp /src/wireshark/epan/dissectors/packet-udp.c:1267:3\n    #33 0x6d77a2 in call_dissector_through_handle /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:720:9\n    #34 0x6d77a2 in call_dissector_work /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:813:9\n    #35 0x6e07d1 in call_dissector_only /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:3233:8\n    #36 0x6e07d1 in call_all_postdissectors /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:3608:3\n    #37 0x104915b in dissect_frame /src/wireshark/epan/dissectors/packet-frame.c:901:5\n    #38 0x6d77a2 in call_dissector_through_handle /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:720:9\n    #39 0x6d77a2 in call_dissector_work /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:813:9\n    #40 0x6d410b in call_dissector_only /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:3233:8\n    #41 0x6d410b in call_dissector_with_data /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:3246:8\n    #42 0x6d38a4 in dissect_record /src/wireshark/epan/packet.c:594:3\n    #43 0x6c7093 in epan_dissect_run /src/wireshark/epan/epan.c:585:2\n    #44 0x5573d4 in LLVMFuzzerTestOneInput /src/wireshark/fuzz/fuzzshark.c:381:2\n    #45 0x45c2f1 in fuzzer::Fuzzer::ExecuteCallback(unsigned char const*, unsigned long) /src/llvm/projects/compiler-rt/lib/fuzzer/FuzzerLoop.cpp:556:15\n    #46 0x446f11 in fuzzer::RunOneTest(fuzzer::Fuzzer*, char const*, unsigned long) /src/llvm/projects/compiler-rt/lib/fuzzer/FuzzerDriver.cpp:292:6\n    #47 0x44cbce in fuzzer::FuzzerDriver(int*, char***, int (*)(unsigned char const*, unsigned long)) /src/llvm/projects/compiler-rt/lib/fuzzer/FuzzerDriver.cpp:774:9\n    #48 0x476d42 in main /src/llvm/projects/compiler-rt/lib/fuzzer/FuzzerMain.cpp:19:10\n    #49 0x7f2db150682f in __libc_start_main (/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libc.so.6+0x2082f)\n    #50 0x4202c8 in _start (/out/fuzzshark_ip_proto-udp+0x4202c8)\n```\n\nchannels_info->adapter_disconnect_in_frame and channels_info->hci_disconnect_in_frame was uninitialized, segfault occured when dereferencing.\n```\n(gdb) p channels_info->hci_disconnect_in_frame\n$2 = (guint32 *) 0xbebebebebebebebe\n(gdb) p channels_info->adapter_disconnect_in_frame\n$3 = (guint32 *) 0xbebebebebebebebe\n```",
